        "scope": "A shell interprets commands and expands arguments before invoking programs. Quoting affects filenames and data, and command help describes the installed version. Understand a command's target and effect before running it. The working directory can turn a reasonable relative path into the wrong operation.\n\nDeeper-study checklist: Shell navigation, manual pages, filesystem hierarchy. Use the section references to investigate these terms and connect them to the practice evidence.",
