            "instructions": "Create a test folder and disposable account in a VM. Compare intended access with effective access through local and shared paths.\n\nEnvironment: Disposable administration lab. Use only the scope established in section 01.\n\nKeep a short evidence note: expected result, observed result, explanation and one limitation. A paper or synthetic-data version is acceptable where the exercise offers it.",
