        "hours": 2.1666666666666665,
        "scope": "TLS negotiates protected transport and authenticates peers according to configuration. Certificate validation includes a trusted chain, time validity and the intended service identity. A successful encrypted connection with identity checks disabled does not establish that you reached the right peer.\n\nDeeper-study checklist: TLS 1.3, transcript binding, hostname validation. Use the section references to investigate these terms and connect them to the practice evidence.",
