            "instructions": "Central policy and delegated administration can change many endpoints. Review who can edit policies, link them and control privileged groups. Separate everyday accounts from high-privilege administration. A small misdelegation may create a much larger path to important identities.\n\nDeeper-study checklist: GPO control, delegation, administrative separation. Use the section references to investigate these terms and connect them to the practice evidence.\n\nThink about this: Why review who can change a policy, not only its settings?",
