        "route": "Core",
        "hours": 2.8333333333333335,
        "scope": "Caching can expose personalized content when keys omit relevant context. Race conditions occur when interleaving breaks an invariant across checks and updates. Repeated requests, retries and concurrent jobs require atomicity or idempotency appropriate to the workflow.\n\nDeeper-study checklist: Cache poisoning, cache deception, TOCTOU, race conditions. Use the section references to investigate these terms and connect them to the practice evidence.",
