        "scope": "APIs need checks for the requested object, the properties read or changed and the function being invoked. A user allowed to edit a profile must not gain permission to set its administrative role. Enforce field ownership at the server rather than trusting a submitted object.\n\nDeeper-study checklist: BOLA, BOPLA, BFLA, mass assignment. Use the section references to investigate these terms and connect them to the practice evidence.",
