        "domainName": "Database, data pipeline and storage security",
        "route": "Core",
        "hours": 2.8333333333333335,
        "scope": "Consumers must validate message structure, authority and ordering assumptions. Duplicate delivery and delayed events are normal design conditions in many systems. Poison messages need bounded retries and a controlled dead-letter process. Do not let a failed consumer silently accumulate sensitive unprotected data.\n\nDeeper-study checklist: Kafka-style streams, queues, ordering, replay. Use the section references to investigate these terms and connect them to the practice evidence.",
