        "scope": "YARA matches file or memory content patterns under a rule; a match is an indicator, not automatic attribution. Use stable features and benign counterexamples, and document collection conditions. A useful report connects observed behavior, uncertainty and response actions rather than listing unverified capabilities.\n\nDeeper-study checklist: YARA, family labels, false positives, evidence-supported reporting. Use the section references to investigate these terms and connect them to the practice evidence.",
