        "route": "Core",
        "hours": 2.8333333333333335,
        "scope": "Enterprise wireless combines device or user credentials, authentication servers and certificate validation. A convincing network name does not prove the access point or identity service is legitimate. Client validation, managed profiles and monitoring reduce exposure to unauthorized infrastructure.\n\nDeeper-study checklist: 802.1X, EAP, RADIUS, certificate validation. Use the section references to investigate these terms and connect them to the practice evidence.",
