            "title": "Practice: Enterprise wireless and rogue infrastructure",
            "kind": "Lab",
            "minutes": 105,
            "instructions": "Diagram a fictional enterprise authentication flow. Identify which certificate or identity checks distinguish a legitimate service from an imitation.\n\nEnvironment: High-impact and specialist simulation lab. Use only the scope established in section 01.\n\nKeep a short evidence note: expected result, observed result, explanation and one limitation. A paper or synthetic-data version is acceptable where the exercise offers it.",
