            "id": "verify",
            "title": "Explain and verify: Enterprise wireless and rogue infrastructure",
            "kind": "Assessment",
            "minutes": 25,
            "instructions": "Why is the SSID not a trustworthy identity?\n\nAnswer without notes first. Then compare with the topic recall answer or the exercise rubric. Explain one limitation and repeat or defend the main check independently. If you need guidance, revisit the lesson before claiming an independent result.",
            "checklist": [],
