        "hours": 2.8333333333333335,
        "scope": "Transport validation, browser or WebView configuration and token lifetimes form a connected trust model. Avoid exposing privileged native bridges to untrusted content. Certificate pinning has operational and recovery tradeoffs and must not substitute for normal validation. Keep session material out of logs and shared URLs.\n\nDeeper-study checklist: TLS, WebViews, native bridges, OAuth app flows. Use the section references to investigate these terms and connect them to the practice evidence.",
