        "hours": 3.75,
        "scope": "Hardware can expose debug ports, removable storage, boot selectors and external buses. Physical access changes the threat model but does not automatically defeat all protection. Identify assets and trust anchors, and use documentation or owned training boards rather than altering operational devices.\n\nDeeper-study checklist: UART, JTAG, SWD, SPI, I2C, device ownership. Use the section references to investigate these terms and connect them to the practice evidence.",
