        "recovery": "Document directory reset, cleanup and restoration of local trust settings.",
        "location": "Owned local environment or paper alternative; setup is chosen and controlled by you."
      },
      {
        "id": "LAB-CLOUD",
        "title": "Cloud-design and optional sandbox lab",
